# Always state the next step

Until the user can run the local stack with documented commands (`docker compose` from `infrastructure/` + api-gateway health + vision-engine health) and that milestone is ticked in `docs/main_plan.md`, every assistant reply must end with:

```text
Next step: <step id> — <title from docs/main_plan.md>
```

- Use the real next incomplete step from `docs/main_plan.md`, not a vague phase name.
- If blocked (e.g. missing env secret, Docker not available), say that under Next step and name what the user must provide.
- After local run is fully done per the plan, stop adding this footer unless the user asks to keep it.
